# Red Block Kennel

A modern and bold website designed for Red Block Kennel, showcasing their American Pitbull Terrier breeding program, bloodlines, available pups, and kennel standards.

## Features

* Strong hero section with clear call-to-action
* Kennel introduction and brand story
* Available bloodlines and puppies section
* Dog profiles with images and breed information
* Kennel standards and breeding principles
* Dogs in action gallery
* Client testimonials
* Contact and inquiry section
* Responsive and image-focused layout
* Dark, premium visual style with red and gold accents

## Design

The website uses a dark background with gold and red highlights to create a strong, premium, and masculine visual identity. Large typography, high-quality dog photography, structured content sections, and clear CTAs help create an engaging experience while keeping the focus on the kennel and its dogs.

